   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 10,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "Adding workers beyond the provider TPM budget only lengthens the queue. The honest lever is the budget itself (provisioned throughput, a second cloud),\nthen the MemoCache hit rate, then the model tier for verification. Queue depth is exposed as 429 + Retry-After, never hidden in a buffer.",
   "originalText": "Adding workers beyond the provider TPM budget only lengthens the queue. The honest lever is the budget itself (provisioned throughput, a second cloud),\nthen the MemoCache hit rate, then the model tier for verification. Queue depth is exposed as 429 + Retry-After, never hidden in a buffer.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
